{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D36FE0674B3C680DBB4E7CAA1C7A2DAB", "source_en": "Leave Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اترك قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D3CC3E3E482AB2A73A9406B36E5799A9", "source_en": "Bring Gajov infernal energy. Lots infernal energy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر لقاجوف طاقة جحيمية. طاقة جحيمية كثيرة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D7A270A24E5FF81E704C14A22A98D78F", "source_en": "Gajov no like staring.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف لا يحب التحديق.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D7E80C5E439286D508099FBF7F1EDF58", "source_en": "Come, let Gajov forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تعال، دع قاجوف يطرق.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D9ECDEA644AE228D31892CB1D6D859AC", "source_en": "Huh?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هاه؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|D9FFE8464FE3A0DF55EDC7A60726FC6F", "source_en": "Fetch pup, fetch.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "إحضار، أيها الجرو، إحضار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DA72E3B641E2314642363F914928CF6D", "source_en": "Good choice.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اختيار جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DADCD80F49B064C3E7073EAE1D47AE5A", "source_en": "Good, Gajov's waited for a moment like this. Heheheh", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جيد، قاجوف انتظر لحظة كهذه. هيهيهيه", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DB2E706044D118B3DBE336BA62EAACA2", "source_en": "Reforge the demon sword?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "إعادة صهر سيف الشيطان؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DC2CF9B54E660810EDE5BDB735812380", "source_en": "Blood... Bring Gajov blood.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "دم... أحضر دم لقاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DD609487407004DEB018EE9F7D2DD077", "source_en": "No touch sword! ...Not ready. More hit.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا تلمس السيف! ...ليس جاهزاً. ضربات أكثر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DD652A2C43604BD7ACBAA48F6B87BCDE", "source_en": "Need Gajov?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تحتاج قاجوف؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|DD88904A4B4770DCD11B5EB00D881650", "source_en": "Mereda? Hmm. Let Gajov see.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ميريدا؟ همم. قاجوف يرى.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|E0F1415B4D9A29A86834A49DE24F73D0", "source_en": "Monks always watching... Bad monks... Good Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "رهبان يراقبون... رهبان أشرار... قاجوف طيب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|E2C044594B0B47342147C5BFBA7AA1B1", "source_en": "Mine now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ملكي الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|E4F3D85C4713E8DC87C206B11B376F23", "source_en": "No talk. Always talk. Always lies.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا كلام. كلام دائم. أكاذيب دائم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|E837A1064DA54E0320C69990D78CE91C", "source_en": "Don't touch sword! Not ready!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا تلمس سيف! ليس جاهز!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|EB08666547FE0E0D814E96B687D7078C", "source_en": "Ore for Gajov?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خام لقاجوف؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|EB3CFA79481E87BA6F9899AA42396F0F", "source_en": "Come pup, Gajov help make strong.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تعال أيها الجرو، قاجوف يساعد صنع قوي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|ECDB1A3343D3E757729E04BEEA23A52E", "source_en": "Smithing.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حدادة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|EFDB71404CEC4205D3D4F0BA0D94EE59", "source_en": "Gone now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "انتهى الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F00DC91A41F5CE4F777E4A88278313D5", "source_en": "Go. Come back when ready.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اذهب. عد عندما جاهز.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F0E488A344E32040C34811BAAAC4BD1F", "source_en": "Go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اذهب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F1CAFFA041D8199B4446C782E6A69F18", "source_en": "Here, this yours. Don't die.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ، هذا لك. لا تمت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F33541B741B00D729CE167938EBD0D32", "source_en": "You... thank you... pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أنت... شكراً... أيها الجرو.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F45EA05B4D979D28288C709E7F3DB2C8", "source_en": "Trust in Gajov, Vodor. Gajov fix.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ثق بقاجوف، فودور. قاجوف يصلح.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F493DB0E4FA3E137B9F4ABBA69BF7CBF", "source_en": "Gallant says you face a god.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قالانت يقول تواجه إلهاً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F53448DB4F3F91401FD7F79C1E70FFC0", "source_en": "Sharp. Good.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حاد. جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F552E6DA4C853B025B21B6A106285E32", "source_en": "By Vodor and Pack in the sky! Mighty fangs for a true dire wolf of Karsiv! ", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "بـ فودور وقطيع السماء! أنياب قوية لذئب كارسيف الشرس الحقيقي!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F7BE8FCD4845C4104086338082E747DB", "source_en": "Forge grow cold.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "فرن يبرد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F8CB006441F8AA8BABB5099C9DF6162A", "source_en": "Gajov alone now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف وحده الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|F964E44D4BBCF6742873F5AF73F3227C", "source_en": "Bring Gajov material, Gajov forge. Understand?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر مواد لقاجوف، قاجوف يطرق. فهمت؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FA1F565F4DE0CC14078AD4B42C29C9CB", "source_en": "Gajov forge grow hotter.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "مطرقة قاجوف تزداد حرارة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FB17330E4E82EC6E3395A09DB897619D", "source_en": "Here. Lady Vodor once help Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هنا. السيدة ڤودور ساعدت قاجوف ذات مرة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FBB4E8C74BC555E307FC68BCD093A79F", "source_en": "You bring material. Gajov make blade.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أنت تجلب المواد. قاجوف يصنع النصل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FBC6772F4DB554FC53A420B7F4AD66E6", "source_en": "Okay.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حسناً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FD79BB924DE6D36D75C09390EC732EA2", "source_en": "Not with those tools.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا بأدوات تلك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FEBC1F19419C03512FF7568460AD9065", "source_en": "Gajov sad to see go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف حزين لرحيلك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|FF19EEAA44F7DEA522BF28AC1B42944E", "source_en": "Bring ore?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تجلب خام؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 7}}
